{
  "item": {
    "id": "f15cb20b-65f1-4870-a3d5-37d0d2afc48b",
    "content_type": "generic",
    "workflow_state": "public",
    "page_title": "Transforms endpoint",
    "short_description": "Create and list transform steps for a pipeline via the v2 REST API.",
    "body": "<h1>Transforms endpoint {{ds:component/chip|label=v2|variant=primary}} {{ds:component/chip|label=Stable|variant=success}}</h1>
<p>Manage intermediate <a href="{{cms:item/2ba7297b-657c-4988-a7ed-10b9906bdd0f}}">transform steps</a> that reshape, filter, or enrich <a href="{{cms:item/aaba4e33-be69-4693-8066-1c2f622b674b}}">events</a> in a <a href="{{cms:item/0881cc13-706b-45dc-b215-08b706dc8fdb}}">pipeline</a>. Transform output payloads are validated against configured <a href="{{cms:item/88ecedb3-543b-4dcf-b985-6fb94e4eaa95}}">schemas</a>.</p>

<h2 id="create">Create a transform step</h2>
<p><code>POST /v2/pipelines/&#123;pipeline_id&#125;/transforms</code></p>

{{ds:component/parameter-table|rows_html=<tr><td><code>type</code></td><td>string</td><td>Yes</td><td>One of <code>reshape</code>, <code>filter</code>, <code>enrich</code>.</td></tr><tr><td><code>config</code></td><td>object</td><td>Yes</td><td>Type-specific configuration (e.g. rename rules, filter conditions, or enrichment fields).</td></tr><tr><td><code>order</code></td><td>integer</td><td>No</td><td>0-indexed position in the transform pipeline. Defaults to appending to the end.</td></tr>}}

{{ds:component/code-block|filename=create-transform.sh|language=bash|code=curl -X POST https://api.godzilladocs.dev/v2/pipelines/pl_ingest_orders/transforms \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $GODZILLA_API_KEY" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '&#123;
    "type": "filter",
    "config": &#123;
      "condition": "payload.amount_cents > 0"
    &#125;
  &#125;'}}

<h2 id="list">List transform steps</h2>
<p><code>GET /v2/pipelines/&#123;pipeline_id&#125;/transforms</code> — returns the ordered list of transform steps configured for a pipeline.</p>

{{ds:component/code-block|filename=list-transforms-response.json|language=json|code=&#123;
  "data": [
    &#123;
      "id": "tr_filter_orders",
      "pipeline_id": "pl_ingest_orders",
      "type": "filter",
      "order": 0,
      "config": &#123; "condition": "payload.amount_cents > 0" &#125;
    &#125;,
    &#123;
      "id": "tr_reshape_orders",
      "pipeline_id": "pl_ingest_orders",
      "type": "reshape",
      "order": 1,
      "config": &#123; "rename": &#123; "customer_email": "email" &#125;, "drop": ["raw_ip"] &#125;
    &#125;
  ]
&#125;}}

{{ds:component/alert|variant=warning|title=Order of execution|body_html=<p>Transforms run sequentially in order. Placing filter steps before reshape or enrichment steps prevents unnecessary processing on events that will be dropped.</p>}}

{{ds:component/docs-toc|items_html=<li><a href="#create">Create a transform step</a></li><li><a href="#list">List transform steps</a></li>}}",
